<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-139" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin-ws803181">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001:m0000" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">何後</persName>亦淫泆，私於<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001:m0008" ref="iop_ybd_afm">帝</persName>左右<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001:m0011" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">楊鈱</persName>，與同寢處如伉儷；又與帝相愛狎，故帝恣之。迎後親戚入宮，以耀靈殿處之。齋閣通夜洞開，外內淆雜，無復分別。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001:m0065" ref="w4m_9tw_147">西昌侯鸞</persName>遣<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001:m0070" ref="usc_jkv_uhn">坦之</persName>入奏誅鈱，何後流涕覆面曰：「<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-139-yangmin:p001:m0086" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">楊郎</persName>好年少，無罪，何可枉殺！」坦之附耳語帝曰：「外間並雲楊鈱與皇后有情，事彰遐邇，不可不誅。」帝不得已許之；俄敕原之，已行刑矣。</p>
</text>
